    PAID --> ACCEPTED: MerchantAdminService.transition
    ACCEPTED --> DELIVERING: MerchantAdminService.transition
    DELIVERING --> COMPLETED: MerchantAdminService.transition
    DELIVERING --> RECEIVED: OrderWorkflowService.receive
    COMPLETED --> RECEIVED: OrderWorkflowService.receive
    RECEIVED --> Unreviewed: OrderWorkflowService.reviewable
    Unreviewed --> Reviewed: review(user, orderId, scores, content)
    Reviewed --> [*]
    PAID --> [*]: 越权/非法跳转/已取消
